Z||000002||My7Fieros||08-21-2001||01:47 AM||||I actually came across an old Fiero commerical on one of my video tapes of "ALF" episodes about a year ago. If I recall, the commercial had a couple comming out of a restaurant, and the valet parking guy pulled up in their (86-88) red fastback. When the couple was getting in, a man approached them and was in awe admiring the car. He asked the owner "is it Italian?"...'no'..."is it German?"...'no'...."is it British"...'no'..the owner said and drove off...the admiring man stood there in confusing and awe as the couple drove off, showing the red lit up "PONTIAC" on the tail lights........... <BR>Then the "ride Pontiac ride" song came on and they said "The all new Fiero GT from Pontiac, we build driving excitement" (or something to that effect).<BR>I'll have to hunt around and see if I can find it................<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||1
