Z||000004||StuGood||08-21-2001||10:14 AM||||I remember one where this gal is approaching her Fiero (which parked by the curb, in a city setting) and finds a police office standing there, getting ready to put a ticket on her car.  "What's the problem, officer?" she asks.  <P>"It looks too fast - I was going to give you a speeding ticket,"  Of course, the car is just sitting there, parked.  So the officer asks her what kind of car it is.  "It's a Pontiac Fiero," says she, and goes on to describe the wonderful features of the car, etc.  Finally, the officer says, "Well, alright, I'm going to let you go this time - just watch it."<P>...something like that  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   ||||reg||6
